==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~100 seconds<sup>1,600f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~50 seconds<sup>900f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~86.67 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 133.33~266.67 seconds<sup>4,000f~8,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Immediately start sending out [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]]. After the zombies start popping up from the ground, start sending out meatshields to stall them. This should be easy as there will be only 3 zombie enemies. Keep using meatshields until your Giraffe Cats destroy the base.

